# Coins in the Hopper
# A three-note fare-box chime starts the crossing. The bass answers on the last sixteenth.
# One row per sixteenth. Section names in the order list give the complete form.
track kick note vel
track snare note vel
track hat note vel
track rim note vel
track bass note vel
track hook note vel
track answer note vel
track chord note vel cva cvb

